phase P1
title Pre-work prototype
description
    Class: not readily verifiable.
    Kind: verification-suite.
    Goal: the last prototyping: entities, streams, persisted record migration across deploys,
    round 13's H1 and H2, and M5 settled, each recorded in the design (OD52 to OD54).
    Verified by: each area's suite slice, test first, and an adversarial four-angle re-audit by
    an Opus auditor that did not build it, writing its own wrong runtimes from the proposal
    (roadmap amendment 10).
    One iteration: one round on one area, building against its slice.
    Exit criteria: each area settled in the design and listed for the user's read; its slice
    passes and is audited; `listen.load` and `fragstore.row` pass; H1 and H2 fixed and pinned;
    M5 settled or listed.
    False pass: designs that fit the harness but not real apps. Caught by: one path per area fed
    from a real source (a real `fetch`, EventSource or SDK call).
    Gates: the old suite, falsify, lies, the graph gate and the reference model.
    Budget: the Epic's Budget section, row P0 to P2 (spent: 15 rounds allowed).
    Failure limit: 2.
    Stops: a guarantee change. User's read: each area's settled decisions (now notes).
    Prototype: yes.
    Draws from: skill:policy-testing for each slice's audit; skill:policy-convergence when reviews
    repeat a root cause.
